CYBRA MODULE 12 — DELIVERY / RECEIPT CONTROLLER
PATCH_ID=CYBRA-M12-PATCH-0001

1. DELIVERY IS A REQUIRED CONDITION.
2. DELIVERY EVIDENCE IS REQUIRED.
3. BUYER RECEIPT IS A REQUIRED CONDITION.
4. Every delivery evidence record MUST identify the exact ORDER_ID.
5. Every delivery evidence record MUST match the exact ORDER_HASH.
6. Every delivery evidence record MUST match the exact TERMS_HASH.
7. Every delivery evidence record MUST identify the expected BUYER_ADDRESS.
8. Every delivery evidence record MUST identify the expected SELLER_ADDRESS.
9. Every buyer receipt MUST identify the exact ORDER_ID.
10. Every buyer receipt MUST match the exact ORDER_HASH.
11. Every buyer receipt MUST match the exact TERMS_HASH.
12. Every buyer receipt MUST identify the expected BUYER_ADDRESS.
13. Evidence MUST contain a unique evidence ID.
14. Evidence MUST contain a timestamp.
15. Evidence integrity MUST be independently checked.
16. Missing evidence means WAITING/BLOCKED.
17. Invalid evidence means FALSE/RETRY.
18. Mismatched evidence means FALSE/RETRY.
19. Delivery confirmation MUST NOT by itself authorize escrow release.
20. Buyer receipt MUST NOT by itself authorize escrow release.
21. Delivery confirmation MUST NOT create GLOBAL_TRUE_100.
22. Buyer receipt MUST NOT create GLOBAL_TRUE_100.
23. This controller MUST NOT manufacture delivery evidence.
24. This controller MUST NOT manufacture a buyer receipt.
25. This controller MUST NOT sign for buyer or seller.
26. This controller MUST NOT authorize LIVE mode.
27. This controller MUST NOT send a real blockchain transaction.
28. Escrow release requires the independent escrow controller and final authorization.
29. Corrections MUST create a new PATCH_ID.
30. Frozen snapshots MUST NOT be silently modified.
31. TEST evidence MUST NOT automatically become LIVE evidence.
32. Evidence from another ORDER_ID MUST NEVER satisfy this order.
33. Evidence with another TERMS_HASH MUST NEVER satisfy this order.
34. A buyer receipt from another wallet MUST NEVER satisfy the buyer receipt requirement.
